{
  "about": "Gold set B2: the 100 papers drawn in docs/gold-set-b2-sample.json, at random from the live search less gold set B's papers (#695). Two passes of Claude Opus proposed the labels against docs/gold-set-b-guide.md, and the owner checked them (#701). The owner checked 43 papers: the 33 where the passes differed, a pass was unsure, or the proposal differed from the rules or a model alone, and 10 of the other 67 drawn at random with seed 7002026. That sample found no error, so the other 57 were accepted as proposed. The owner changed 0 of the 100 labels against docs/gold-set-b2-proposed.csv. Gold set B2 is held out: nobody changes the rules or the prompt because of a paper in it, and a report gives its scores and never the ids of what it missed. Each paper lists its grant references, normalised, or none. Ids and references only, never text.",
